[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4322170592","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/118967#issuecomment-4322170592","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118967","id":4322170592,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABAZ8W4A","user":{"login":"tomyy","id":7042019,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcwNDIwMTk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7042019?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tomyy","html_url":"https://github.com/tomyy","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tomyy/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tomyy/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tomyy/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tomyy/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tomyy/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tomyy/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tomyy/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tomyy/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tomyy/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-04-26T13:49:03Z","updated_at":"2026-04-26T13:56:15Z","body":"The problem seems to be in `editor/import/3d/scene_import_settings.cpp` line 593 (https://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/master/editor/import/3d/scene_import_settings.cpp#L593). That line searches recursively for the \"collider_view\" children of the current mesh when it probably should only search for a direct child node.\n\nIn my local tests changing that line from\n\n```\n\t\tTypedArray<Node> descendants = mesh_node->find_children(\"collider_view\", \"MeshInstance3D\");\n```\n\nto\n\n```\n\t\tTypedArray<Node> descendants = mesh_node->find_children(\"collider_view\", \"MeshInstance3D\", false);\n```\n\nfixes the problem for me.\n\n<img width=\"1010\" height=\"560\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/cf68a032-740f-4718-9bf9-5ec7cea9d54f\" />","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4322170592/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]